sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Member as 📖 Student / Faculty Member
    actor Librarian as 📚 Librarian
    participant Desk as 🖥️ Circulation Desk UI
    participant LibService as ⚙️ Library Service
    participant DB as 🗄️ Database

    Member->>Librarian: Presents Library ID & Book Copy Barcode
    Librarian->>Desk: Scans Member Card (MEM-2026-042)
    Desk->>LibService: GET /api/v1/library/members/:id
    LibService->>DB: Check Member status & current active BookIssues count
    
    alt Max Books Limit Reached (e.g. already has 3 books checked out)
        LibService-->>Desk: 403 Forbidden: Max books limit reached
        Desk-->>Librarian: Block Checkout (Show active issued titles)
    else Limit Available
        Librarian->>Desk: Scans Book Barcode (BC-98421)
        Desk->>LibService: POST /api/v1/library/issues/checkout { memberId, copyBarcode }
        LibService->>DB: Atomic Tx [Create BookIssue (dueDate = now + 14 days), BookCopy.status = ISSUED]
        LibService-->>Desk: Checkout Confirmed (Due: 14 days)
        Desk-->>Member: Print Checkout Slip / Mobile Notification

        Note over Member, Librarian: Return & Overdue Fine Settlement
        Member->>Librarian: Returns Book Copy
        Librarian->>Desk: Scans Return Barcode
        Desk->>LibService: POST /api/v1/library/issues/return { bookCopyId }
        
        alt Returned On Time (Return Date <= Due Date)
            LibService->>DB: Atomic Tx [BookIssue.status = RETURNED, BookCopy.status = AVAILABLE]
            LibService-->>Desk: Return Processed (Zero Fine)
        else Returned Overdue (Late by N Days)
            LibService->>DB: Calculate Overdue Days & Rate ($1.00 / day)
            LibService->>DB: Atomic Tx [BookIssue.status = RETURNED, BookCopy.status = AVAILABLE, Create Fine]
            LibService-->>Desk: Alert: Overdue Fine Incurred
            Librarian->>Desk: Settles Fine via Cash / Challan
            Desk->>LibService: POST /api/v1/library/fines/:id/pay
            LibService->>DB: Update Fine isPaid = true
            LibService-->>Member: Fine Cleared Receipt
        end
    end
